{
  "scenario_name": "maian_vehicle_room_boost_smoke",
  "description": "The Maian hover vehicle's boost and heat where no mission can end the ride (B-1241). The same vehicle, inputs and checks as maian_vehicle_boost_smoke, which runs on Escape, where the mission's own script now takes the player out of the vehicle a second after it moves. Here the level is the Blank Room with a hoverbike that Forge's level document adds at boot, played in a Combat Simulator match with no simulants. Boost is held for 10 s: ramp, full, the crystals turn black (part 140 hidden) and the turret is locked, then recovery after release and the crystals come back. The room's far wall stops the vehicle a second or so into the boost, as Escape's hangar wall did when this smoke passed there; the heat follows the held input, not the speed. Any dismount fails the run.",
